# Pavilion ship & deploy (mandatory for agents)

Pavilion deploys to **`robert-4220s-projects`**. Product ships here first.

Master map: `~/shmspto/docs/AGENT-SHIP-MAP.md` and `~/.cursor/rules/agent-ship-map.mdc`.

## After product application code ships

```bash
node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo
```

| `--target` | Production URL | When |
|------------|----------------|------|
| `commons-pto-demo` | https://commons-pto-demo.vercel.app | Default — product demo / trials |
| `commons-site` | https://onpavilion.com | Marketing |
| `commons-pto` | https://commons-pto.vercel.app | Legacy — only if Rob asks |

**Demo ship ≠ Stone Hill live.** Do not tell anyone www updated unless you promoted + shipped SHMS.

## Promote to SHMS (customer ship — intentional)

```bash
node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs
# then ~/shmspto: node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs
```

Avoid during school hours unless hotfix. www is production.

## Doppler

**`pavilion` / `dev`** — `./scripts/doppler_run.sh` or `./scripts/vercel-robert4220.sh`.

## Forbidden

- Bare `npx vercel`
- `deploy-pavilion.mjs` directly
- Treasurer scope / Stone Hill deploy from this repo
- Auto-promote after every product ship

## Success criteria

`node scripts/check-pavilion-deploy.mjs --target …` passes for the product ship.
